# API

## 1. Auth & Account

### 1.1 Login
POST http://localhost:9091/v1/account/sessions/email
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_LOGIN_IDENTIFIER}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_LOGIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.2 Register / Signup
POST http://localhost:9091/v1/account
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userId": "unique()",
    "email": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_PASSWORD}}",
    "name": "{{$dotenv USER_REGISTER_USERNAME}}"
}

### 1.3 Profile
GET http://localhost:9091/v1/account
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}

## 2. Content

### 2.1 Student

### 2.1.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9091/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_STUDENT_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "documentId": "unique()",
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CREATE_NAME}}",
    "mobile": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CREATE_MOBILE}}",
    "cardId": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CREATE_CARD_ID}}"
  }
}

### 2.1.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9091/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_STUDENT_ID}}/documents
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}

### 2.1.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9091/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_STUDENT_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}

### 2.1.4 Update
PATCH http://localhost:9091/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_STUDENT_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_UPDATE_NAME}}",
    "mobile": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_UPDATE_MOBILE}}",
    "cardId": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_UPDATE_CARD_ID}}"
  }
}

### 2.1.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9091/v1/databases/{{$dotenv APPWRITE_DATABASE_ID}}/collections/{{$dotenv COLLECTION_STUDENT_ID}}/documents/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
X-Appwrite-Project: {{$dotenv APPWRITE_PROJECT_ID}}

